tllama (1.0.0~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging of the TLlama client and daemon.
  * Depend on the separate tllama-server native runtime package.
  * Install server configuration and manage the tllamad systemd service.
  * Preserve upstream version metadata when building without Git history.

